OL,3,GNEWSALondon's NYE firework tickets on
OL,4,Asale - how to buy
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe first batch of tickets for London's
OL,7,FNew Year's Eve fireworks display go on
OL,8,Fsale at midday, with about 100,000
OL,9,Fpeople expected to attend the annual
OL,10,Fevent on the banks of the River Thames.
OL,12,FThe display will begin after Big Ben
OL,13,Fstrikes midnight, with fireworks and
OL,14,Flight projections illuminating the sky
OL,15,Faround the London Eye.
OL,17,FTicket prices for Londoners will remain
OL,18,Fat #20 or #35, depending on the viewing
OL,19,Farea. For people living outside the
OL,20,Fcapital, tickets will cost #40 or #55.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
