OL,3,GNEWSALondon's NYE firework tickets on
OL,4,Asale - how to buy
OL,5,
OL,6,FCity Hall warned that only tickets
OL,7,Fbought from the authorised outlet
OL,8,FTicketmaster will be accepted. A
OL,9,Fsmaller final batch of tickets will be
OL,10,Freleased later in the year.
